      "en": "“Will the Lord reject us forever? Will he be favorable no more?",
      "ko": "주께서 영원히 버리실까, 다시는 은혜를 베풀지 아니하실까,",
      "source_text_hash": "f59886a2cdfb46dad296b8967b8dc7a47a8bda04272c3dd420ece1c0024a33f7",
      "translation_text_hash": "9a63aefb99b790ff3d25c91e5298edcd89bf61279de62ce9114988b4e7223ba0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "주께서 영원히 버리실까, 다시는 은혜를 베풀지 아니하실까,"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9a63aefb99b790ff3d25c91e5298edcd89bf61279de62ce9114988b4e7223ba0"
      ]
    },
