      "en": "Has his loving kindness vanished forever? Does his promise fail for generations?",
      "ko": "그 인자하심이 길이 다하였는가, 그 허락을 영구히 폐하셨는가,",
      "source_text_hash": "3e3e6275658fe4075acb2c0e6f0dc8e505e3f0363a229ef596fb4f9462c92cd0",
      "translation_text_hash": "be9a523ce698918fce8547d9a572bd443b63a5aa81c005aa78aff7c2e861f323",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
